--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
Lazy-wave power cable with a clamped hang-off on a vessel moving with its RAOs in a JONSWAP sea
-- Geometry and properties match lozon_gomex80_power_cable.dat. The vessel moves as the response of
-- a displacement RAO table to the deck sea; the same wave components load the cable, so the
-- vessel and the line see one sea. The RAO values in data/vessel/sample_rao.txt are illustrative.
-- The hang-off is clamped (Rigid) along the static fairlead tangent, so the clamp turns with the
-- vessel and BendMom1N1 reports the connection moment at End A.
